WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.992
Parity runs every strategy through 11 tests.

2
00:00:02.992 --> 00:00:04.896
Here is carry.

3
00:00:05.196 --> 00:00:07.888
Group A asks whether it beats the

4
00:00:07.888 --> 00:00:11.331
S&P 500. It passes none of six.

5
00:00:11.631 --> 00:00:14.323
Group B asks whether anything is real.

6
00:00:14.323 --> 00:00:16.996
It passes three of five.

7
00:00:17.296 --> 00:00:18.450
Reshuffled 1,000 times,

8
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.142
its Sharpe stays between 0.00 and 0.75.

9
00:00:21.142 --> 00:00:23.815
The deflated Sharpe is 0.44.

10
00:00:24.115 --> 00:00:26.788
3 of 11 tests passed.

11
00:00:27.088 --> 00:00:29.396
Some signs of a real effect,

12
00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:31.319
not enough to rely on.

13
00:00:31.319 --> 00:00:36.162
Carry does not beat the S&P 500.
